# Local Worker secrets for `wrangler dev` / `opennextjs-cloudflare preview`.
# Copy to .dev.vars (git-ignored). In stage/prod these are `wrangler secret`s
# set by the deploy lane from orun-managed secrets.
#
# This template has none: the tenant store is the KV binding (no Upstash
# URL/token), and the admin page carries upstream's "add authentication
# here" TODO rather than a password.
